  "note": "Public list prices read from the vendors' pricing pages on 2026-10-18, USD per 1M tokens, standard tier, no discounts, batch or regional uplift. Use with HARNESS_PRICING_TABLE. Not priced here (stay unknown): Google Gemini Live (rates differ by modality but the adapter reports only unclassified totals, and the page row is 'Gemini 2.5 Flash Live API', matched to gemini-live-2.5-flash-native-audio by name only); Bedrock Claude Haiku 4.5 judge (the judge uses the us. geo profile; only the global cross-region rate of $1.00 in / $5.00 out was readable); and every quota. Rounding and minimum-billing rules are not documented on these pages and are not applied. xAI: $0.08/min is the 'STS' (speech-to-speech) Voice API rate; the page does not name grok-voice-3.0, so the mapping is an assumption. It is applied to the provider-reported billable_audio_seconds with no rounding or minimum (none documented); token meters are an unpriced alternative in the same exclusivity group, so they do not make a run partial.",
